# Frontend env (Vite). Copy to `.env.local` for local overrides if needed.
# Leave VITE_API_URL unset in local `npm run dev` so relative paths go
# through the Vite proxy (see vite.config.ts → http://127.0.0.1:8002).
#
# Production (Vercel): set to the public Render backend URL, no trailing slash.
# VITE_API_URL=https://your-backend.onrender.com
